        <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-200);">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:10px;">Personal Information</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">We collect information you provide directly: name, email address, phone number, physical address, and payment information when you register or transact with us.</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:10px;">Device & Usage Data</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">For smart home products, we collect device status, usage patterns, energy data, and automation logs to provide the service. For AI services, we collect input data as necessary to run AI models.</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:10px;">Automatically Collected Data</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px;">We collect IP addresses, browser type, pages visited, and interactions through cookies and similar technologies.</p>
      </section>

