        <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-200);">3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">We do not sell your personal data. We may share data with trusted service providers under strict confidentiality agreements, or when required by law. We do not share your smart home or AI usage data with third parties for advertising.</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px;"><strong>Data Sovereignty:</strong> Client data is stored in the same region as the client's primary operation (West Africa, East Africa, or Southern Africa) and does not leave the continent without explicit consent.</p>
