        <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:16px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-200);">4. Security</h2>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px;">We implement AES-256 encryption, TLS 1.3 for all data in transit, role-based access controls, regular security audits, and two-factor authentication. Smart home device communications use end-to-end encryption where supported.</p>
